title: Labour Inspection Is a Ministry Now
subtitle: Use office before the coalition reclaims the agenda.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_government_card
view-if: left_in_government = 1 and government_has_confidence = 1 and caretaker_government = 0 and labor_minister_party = "Lewica" and month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_labor_inspection_timer <= 0 and (labor_credibility < 85 or workers_support < 75)
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; poland_labor_inspection_timer = 4
card-image: img/poland/deck_parliament.svg

= Labour inspection

The coalition agrees on enforcement and disputes the money.

- @fund
- @target
- @memo

@fund
title: Fund inspectors and regional offices
subtitle: Cost: 2 budget capacity.
choose-if: budget >= 2 and labor_minister_party = "Lewica"
unavailable-subtitle: Requires the Labour Ministry and two budget points.
on-arrival: budget -= 2; labor_credibility += 7; workers_support += 5; government_delivery += 5; ko_coalition_dissent += 3; news_headline = "Labour inspection receives staff and enforcement power"

- #poland_card_finish

@target
title: Target wage theft with the existing staff
subtitle: No budget cost; narrower effect.
on-arrival: labor_credibility += 3; workers_support += 2; government_delivery += 2; news_headline = "Inspectors concentrate on wage theft"

- #poland_card_finish

@memo
title: Publish the enforcement gap
subtitle: Preserve capacity and shift responsibility to the coalition.
on-arrival: public_trust += 1; ko_coalition_dissent += 2; labor_dissent += 2; news_headline = "The ministry publishes the cost of inaction"

- #poland_card_finish
